### Variables (extension REST Client de VS Code ou IntelliJ HTTP Client)
@host = http://localhost:8080/api

### Connexion participant
# @name login
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "participant1@movent.test", "password": "Password123!" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Catalogue public
GET {{host}}/events?free=0

### Profil
GET {{host}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Réserver (remplacer EVENT_ID par un id du catalogue)
POST {{host}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "event_id": "EVENT_ID", "quantity": 2 }

### Payer (succès) — remplacer BOOKING_ID
POST {{host}}/bookings/BOOKING_ID/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "outcome": "success" }

### Mes billets
GET {{host}}/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Test de sécurité : les routes internes doivent être refusées (403)
POST {{host}}/events/EVENT_ID/hold
Content-Type: application/json

{ "booking_id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000099", "quantity": 1 }

### Connexion admin
# @name adminlogin
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@movent.test", "password": "Password123!" }

###
@admintoken = {{adminlogin.response.body.token}}

### Événements en attente
GET {{host}}/admin/events?status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{admintoken}}

### Rejeter (motif obligatoire)
POST {{host}}/events/EVENT_ID/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{admintoken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Description insuffisante" }
